<title>USA: Collagen sees operating expenses rising.</title>
<headline>Collagen sees operating expenses rising.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collagen Corp said it expects its operating expenses to increase slightly over the next several quarters, about one to two percent per quarter.</p>
<p>The increased costs will result from its plans to separate its aesthetic medicine business and in exploring and evaluating strategies for the new company.</p>
</text>
